  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>750</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br />Using the relation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub></mfrac></math>, resistance of galvanometer is<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>750</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"